      "title_en": "Reduced summer carbon dioxide efflux from semi-arid agrivoltaic compared to conventional horticultural soil",
      "title_zh": "与传统园艺土壤相比，半干旱地区农光互补系统的夏季二氧化碳排放量有所减少",
      "link": "https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1748-9326/aeb1dd",
      "source": "Environmental Research Letters",
      "published": "2026-10-21T23:00:00+00:00",
      "hotness": 82.0,
      "score_v1": 21.43,
      "score_v2": 82.0,
      "score_breakdown": {
